# ListMonk drafts

When editing `drafts/` issue bodies, follow `docs/listmonk-markup.md`.

**Images:** Story photos and gifs use `width="400"` with  
`style="display:block;width:400px;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;"`  
Exceptions: 90px curator portrait; 300px book covers (still centered).

Run `python3 scripts/lint_listmonk_issue.py drafts/YYYY-MM-DD.md` before send.
